items.Deco_Machinaria_Broken_Automaton.description=What is left of a maker's automaton. Head, torso and arm pieces.
items.Deco_Machinaria_Broken_Automaton.name=Broken Automaton
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Bell.description=One of four bells, each with its own note. The clock shows the order.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Bell.name=Chime Bell
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Brake_Pylon.description=A steam pylon. Prime it to burst a charging foe; turn it as a brake when the clock runs down.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Brake_Pylon.name=Brake Pylon
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Breaker.description=A knife-switch breaker. The empty box takes a dynamo fuse.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Breaker.name=Breaker Box
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Cage_Lamp.description=An amber bulb in an iron cage, on a wall bracket or a ceiling chain.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Cage_Lamp.name=Cage Lamp
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Checkpoint.description=A gauge pillar. Walk past it and the works will wind you back here.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Checkpoint.name=Heartworks Checkpoint
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Clutch_Lever.description=Drops a gear into the train. A broken gear jams it.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Clutch_Lever.name=Clutch Lever
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Copper_Cable.description=Glows while it carries power. Straight, corner and tee pieces.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Copper_Cable.name=Copper Cable
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Coupling_Control.description=Engages a coupling. Its gauge fills while the coupling holds.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Coupling_Control.name=Coupling Control
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Coupling_Lamp.description=Lights in its wing's colour when that coupling runs.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Coupling_Lamp.name=Coupling Lamp
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Door_Gauge.description=The big gauge of a pressure door. Two cells wide.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Door_Gauge.name=Door Gauge
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_End_Portal.description=The way back to the surface, open once the Heartwinder runs down.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_End_Portal.name=Way Home
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Exit_Portal.description=Leave the Heartworks early. The run ends for you.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Exit_Portal.name=Heartworks Exit
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Gear_Wall_Plate.description=Three gears in relief, or one big gear alone.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Gear_Wall_Plate.name=Gear Wall Plate
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Hanging_Cable.description=Cables hanging from the ceiling. Straight, looped, or a frayed end that sparks.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Hanging_Cable.name=Hanging Cable
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Hazard_Lamp.description=Amber to warn, red when it is about to fire.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Hazard_Lamp.name=Hazard Lamp
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Input_Lamp.description=Teal beside something you can use; amber once it is done.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Input_Lamp.name=Input Lamp
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Iron_Crate.description=A riveted iron crate. Full, small and open.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Iron_Crate.name=Iron Crate
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lever.description=A floor lever. Its lamp turns amber when it is pulled.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lever.name=Lever
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_1.description=Masters away. Works running. Hearts wound to three hundred turns, as ordered. All gauges true.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_1.name=Winding Log, Entry 1
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_2.description=Masters away. Hearts wound. The north shaft is quiet. I have begun to count each turn twice, to be sure.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_2.name=Winding Log, Entry 212
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_3.description=The hearts come back down the shaft still ticking. I send them up again. Three hundred and one turns. Three hundred and two. A tighter heart wakes faster.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_3.name=Winding Log, Entry 3041
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_4.description=My own spring slips. I hear it in the quiet hours, if there are hours. I wind the hearts tighter so they remember the works when I stop.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_4.name=Winding Log, Entry 9999
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_5.description=Turns: many. Masters: soon. The clock strikes midnight, and then it strikes midnight again. Wind. Wind. Wind.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Log_5.name=Winding Log, Last Entry
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Bells.description=The clock keeps the order of the bells. Ring them as the hand walks. A wrong bell starts the count again.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Bells.name=Archive Rule
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Rails.description=Live rails carry the dynamo's song. Throw the breakers before you walk the yard. A dark lamp means a dead rail.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Rails.name=Danger
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Valves.description=A feed valve opens in four quarter turns. Keep the relief valve shut while a door is fed. Watch the gauges, not your feet.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Valves.name=Pressure Notice
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Vents.description=The floor vents breathe on the beat. Count four and cross. If a grate glows red, wait for the next breath.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Notice_Vents.name=Safety Notice
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Work_Order_Hearts.description=Wind each heart three hundred turns. No more. A heart wound tighter will not sleep. Send finished hearts up the north shaft.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Work_Order_Hearts.name=Work Order 12
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Work_Order_Intake.description=Intake Hall. Sort every part by size before it reaches the line. Spare fuses go in the lit box by the shutter. Do not stand on the vents.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Work_Order_Intake.name=Work Order 1
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Work_Order_Overseer.description=The overseer will keep the works running while we are away. It needs no rest and no orders. We will be back before the next winding.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque_Work_Order_Overseer.name=Work Order 40
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque.description=Keep the works turning. Report every stopped gear to the overseer.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Lore_Plaque.name=Maker's Plaque
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Pressure_Gauge.description=Its needle steps up as pressure builds.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Pressure_Gauge.name=Pressure Gauge
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Segment_Lamp.description=Burns blue while its rail segment is live.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Segment_Lamp.name=Rail Lamp
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Spare_Parts.description=A heap of gears, pipe and bolts. Three looks.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Spare_Parts.name=Spare Parts
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Valve.description=A feed valve. Four quarter turns open it; one press spins it shut.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Valve.name=Steam Valve
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Arc.name=Arc Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Embers.name=Embers Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Floor_Vent.name=Floor Vent Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Furnace_Glow.name=Furnace Glow Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Oil_Drip.name=Oil Drip Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Smoke_Stack.name=Smoke Stack Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Sparks.name=Sparks Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Steam_Leak.name=Steam Leak Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_VFX_Steam_Puff.name=Steam Puff Emitter
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Work_Order_Board.description=The makers' orders for the line, still pinned up.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Work_Order_Board.name=Work Order Board
